Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.07,0:00:04.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I call the phenomenon "Revival."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.27,0:00:12.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I go back in time by about one to five minutes\Nand watch the same scene play out again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.58,0:00:16.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's always right before something bad happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.45,0:00:20.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}As a result, I've prevented\Nseveral accidents from occurring.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.56,0:00:23.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Welcome back, Satoru.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.12,0:00:24.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ma.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.72,0:00:35.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you Fujinuma Satoru-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.84,0:00:37.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I need to take you down to the station.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.54,0:02:17.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did you watch Maskman?\NNext week's the last episode.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.18,0:02:19.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I forgot to watch Black!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.49,0:02:23.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}1988...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.14,0:02:25.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}February the 15th?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.98,0:02:29.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good morning, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.29,0:02:31.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.38,0:02:35.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Satoru?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.68,0:02:37.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take your seat already.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.18,0:02:39.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh, r-right...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.28,0:02:42.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Where was my seat, again?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.70,0:02:49.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you half-asleep, Fujinuma?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.90,0:02:51.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's Hinazuki's desk.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.34,0:02:56.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Monday...\NKayo's late again this week, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.58,0:03:02.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you like Kayo, Fujinuma?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.66,0:03:06.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You two weirdos would make a perfect couple.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.18,0:03:09.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm taking attendance.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.66,0:03:11.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Azuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.66,0:03:11.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is this real life?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.38,0:03:11.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.35,0:03:11.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Abiko.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.24,0:03:12.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.88,0:03:13.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Abe.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.88,0:03:15.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why did I end up here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.72,0:03:14.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Ikuta.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.72,0:03:19.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.02,0:03:19.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.64,0:03:20.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(1110,52.5)}Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.30,0:03:21.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We're talking about 18 years ago here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.72,0:03:31.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How far did you get in Dragon Quest III?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.48,0:03:33.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm level 15 now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.52,0:03:34.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's all?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.44,0:03:36.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just kidding. I'm actually level 25.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.54,0:03:37.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.24,0:03:42.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's up, Satoru?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.08,0:03:45.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My head kinda hurts.\NI'm going to the nurse's office.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.92,0:03:47.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,With your bag?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.72,0:03:51.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.28,0:03:54.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll let the teacher know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.19,0:03:57.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What the hell is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.08,0:03:59.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is this a Revival?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.86,0:04:01.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But why like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.92,0:04:03.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It makes no sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.16,0:04:12.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ma!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.90,0:04:39.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,H-Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.62,0:04:41.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry to keep you waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.90,0:04:47.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh, just some stranger.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.30,0:04:53.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.34,0:04:56.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She would be at work.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.12,0:05:22.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ma...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.58,0:05:39.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.74,0:05:44.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ma.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.02,0:05:45.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Ma"?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.76,0:05:48.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What? I said "Mom."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.16,0:05:50.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You silly goose.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.86,0:05:53.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you want Hamburg steak\Nor meatballs for dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.42,0:05:56.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,H-Hamburg steak.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.08,0:06:13.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll be done soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.24,0:06:26.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just this morning, you threw a tantrum\N'cause your recorder was missing,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.78,0:06:28.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but I guess you're over it already.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.22,0:06:31.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.30,0:06:35.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't have to have a cry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.10,0:06:45.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I had times like these, too, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.42,0:06:47.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Had I forgotten about them?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.14,0:06:50.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No, I just hadn't realized.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.06,0:06:54.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Times I'd never given a second thought to...\N{\i1}And times I'd lost forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.02,0:06:59.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is definitely a Revival.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.20,0:07:03.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A second chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.92,0:07:09.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I won't ever let go of these times again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.27,0:07:11.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.74,0:07:15.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That was great. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.46,0:07:18.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's gotten into you, Satoru?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.14,0:07:18.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the food!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.66,0:07:20.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.02,0:07:27.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Am I going to relive 18 years of my life like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.52,0:07:29.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Morning, Satoru.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.84,0:07:31.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{Y-Yo}H-Hey, Osamu.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.90,0:07:35.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If this actually is a Revival,\NI must be here for a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.94,0:07:38.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It must be to prevent\Nsomething bad from happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.38,0:07:42.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}In other words, is this where\NI have to start to save Ma?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.40,0:07:45.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But why here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.42,0:07:47.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I haven't noticed anything wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.40,0:08:02.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hinazuki Kayo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.86,0:08:05.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She lived with her mother,\Nif my memory serves me right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.18,0:08:09.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}That's awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.88,0:08:10.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}It's perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.26,0:08:16.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A bruise?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.22,0:08:20.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This group really is weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.50,0:08:22.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't talk about Dragon Quest with any of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.65,0:08:24.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.32,0:08:27.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I mean, Hiro's more into Final Fantasy,\Nand Kazu only plays shooters.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.34,0:08:29.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hiro...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.84,0:08:30.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kazu...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.18,0:08:32.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm starting to remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.50,0:08:34.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And Satoru doesn't even have a Nintendo!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.52,0:08:36.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Was that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.80,0:08:41.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But, Osamu, you can't talk to fellow Dragon Quest\Nfans about anything but Dragon Quest, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.72,0:08:45.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I like this group because\Nwe're all into different things.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.82,0:08:46.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kenya.{should we use "Ken'ya"?}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.20,0:08:49.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's a smart guy,\Njust like I thought he was back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.76,0:08:52.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,By the way, Satoru...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.56,0:08:53.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mind if I ask you something?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.80,0:08:55.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.54,0:08:58.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you like Hinazuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.98,0:09:00.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You were staring at her the whole time in class.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.06,0:09:02.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.24,0:09:06.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, he stopped and\Nstared at Hinazuki this morning, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.34,0:09:07.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's this, Satoru?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.96,0:09:10.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you talk to us about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.02,0:09:12.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.54,0:09:13.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wha—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.60,0:09:16.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll set you up with Hinazuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.90,0:09:18.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,K-Keep it down!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.54,0:09:25.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,U-Uh, I wouldn't say that I like her,\Nbut she's been on my mind a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.58,0:09:26.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He said it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.38,0:09:27.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Satoru-kun, you've got guts!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.92,0:09:29.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well said, my boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.64,0:09:32.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll get you to meet with her after school!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.70,0:09:36.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.66,0:09:37.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Not pulling any punches, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.60,0:09:39.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's the first thing you've got to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.08,0:09:42.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I said that out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.48,0:09:44.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Damn that Kazu.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.96,0:09:47.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He went and told her straight up that I like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.34,0:09:51.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,L-Look...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.42,0:09:54.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I thought maybe we could be friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.20,0:09:56.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We go home the same way, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.54,0:10:00.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What about me gave you that idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.24,0:10:03.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This brat is a pain in the ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.64,0:10:05.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I kinda get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.54,0:10:07.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because, Fujinuma,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.16,0:10:10.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you're a fake, just like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.26,0:10:14.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What's with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.32,0:10:16.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What is she saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.00,0:10:19.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I saw you running back home yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.26,0:10:23.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is your mother that important to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.74,0:10:26.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.06,0:10:28.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.12,0:10:32.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,W-Wait, Hinazuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.42,0:10:36.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wanna be friends with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.28,0:10:38.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You wanna be my friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.14,0:10:43.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then...\NCould you kill someone for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.30,0:10:47.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I could've saved her!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.64,0:10:52.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hinazuki was in a bad situation even before she was murdered.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.30,0:10:57.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If I can right this wrong, then maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.86,0:11:11.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because, Fujinuma,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.67,0:11:13.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you're a fake, just like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.22,0:11:16.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's not like she realized I'm posing as my past self.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.56,0:11:20.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}While it's true that I was\Nwinging my way through life,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.28,0:11:23.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I was the same back in elementary school, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.52,0:11:28.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I was playing the role of my ideal self\Nso I could get along with people.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.16,0:11:31.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't be embarrassed. Show some courage.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.50,0:11:37.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.50,0:11:38.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Were you taking a dump in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.50,0:11:39.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It was all so I could fit into this cramped society.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.12,0:11:39.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.36,0:11:41.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Took you long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.00,0:11:43.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I thought you'd fell in!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.00,0:11:43.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She must've seen through that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.04,0:11:45.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Probably clogged the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.04,0:11:45.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She said "just like me,"
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.76,0:11:48.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}which means she's probably the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.88,0:11:52.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've got the hots for her, huh, Satoru?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.90,0:11:55.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Speaking of which, how'd it go with Hinazuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.60,0:11:57.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did you manage to ask her to walk home together?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.04,0:12:00.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,N-Nah, we just chatted a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.00,0:12:02.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You chatted? Alone?\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.98,0:12:05.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That means you've got a chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.95,0:12:08.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No way she'd talk to you alone otherwise!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.94,0:12:10.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}How irritating.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.94,0:12:10.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q2}{\an8}Is there anything else you want me to tell her for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.88,0:12:12.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}This is so exciting!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.88,0:12:12.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}How am I supposed to deal with these morons?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.88,0:12:14.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Quit fooling around, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.64,0:12:16.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What if you rush it and ruin things for him?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.58,0:12:18.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.54,0:12:22.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's still way off, but I appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.28,0:12:23.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Satoru.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.80,0:12:27.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll all still be in the same class\N in sixth grade, so take it slow and steady.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.56,0:12:27.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.88,0:12:34.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}School will be closing shortly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.88,0:12:34.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Come to think of it, when did Hinazuki disappear?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.00,0:12:37.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Time could be running out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.00,0:12:38.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Let's go, Satoru.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.66,0:12:38.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,C-Coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.82,0:12:40.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.88,0:12:44.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't you have a new pair of McGregor gloves?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.56,0:12:47.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh yeah, I did have those.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.94,0:12:49.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think I left them somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.02,0:12:52.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Probably at the hideout.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.54,0:12:56.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You guys wanna stop by the hideout?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.48,0:12:57.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.76,0:13:01.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We decided we wouldn't go right after\Nsnowfall because we'd leave footprints.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.20,0:13:03.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.84,0:13:08.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,See you tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.08,0:13:09.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Laters!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.94,0:13:13.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kenya!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.70,0:13:15.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks for earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.04,0:13:19.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Honestly, it bugs me when people\Nmake a big deal out of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.82,0:13:21.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.52,0:13:22.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.00,0:13:25.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Satoru...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.60,0:13:28.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know why, but I get this feeling that
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.02,0:13:31.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hinazuki being on your mind\Nis something really important.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.62,0:13:34.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This might not be any of my business,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.74,0:13:37.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but you can talk to us if you need anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.22,0:13:41.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sure all of us want to help you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.38,0:13:43.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.62,0:13:45.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I get that they don't mean any harm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.34,0:13:49.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was thanks to Kazu that\NI got to talk to Hinazuki, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.90,0:13:51.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, how'd it really go?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.84,0:13:53.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,With Hinazuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.46,0:13:56.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did you get to talk to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.04,0:13:58.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.04,0:14:00.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think she spoke to me from the heart a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.62,0:14:02.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That so?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.86,0:14:04.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,By the way, Satoru.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.20,0:14:05.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lately, have you...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.38,0:14:09.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,read the student anthology?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.18,0:14:12.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,N-No, I haven't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.14,0:14:15.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's actually pretty interesting.\NGo through it sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.56,0:14:18.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Laters. See you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.62,0:14:19.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Laters.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.20,0:14:29.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kenya was probably referring to Hinazuki's essay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.76,0:14:34.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"The Town With Only Me Erased," by Hinazuki Kayo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.80,0:14:40.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}When I grow older, old enough\Nto go wherever I want by myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.02,0:14:42.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I want to go to a faraway country.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.14,0:14:44.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I want to go to a faraway island.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.44,0:14:47.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I want to go to an island with nobody around.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.40,0:14:52.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I want to go to an island\Nwith no sorrow or suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.72,0:14:59.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}An island without adults, children,\Nclassmates, teachers, or Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.60,0:15:04.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}On that island, I'll climb a tree when I want,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.84,0:15:06.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}swim in the ocean when I want,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.30,0:15:08.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and sleep when I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.78,0:15:14.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And on that island, I'll think about the town\Nfrom which only I've been erased.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.30,0:15:17.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kids will go to school as always,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.46,0:15:20.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}adults will go to work as always,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.72,0:15:24.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and Mom will have dinner as always.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.38,0:15:30.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}When I think about the town from which\NI've been erased, I feel lighthearted.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.30,0:15:34.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I want to go far, far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.16,0:15:39.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hinazuki's essay is most definitely an SOS.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.20,0:15:41.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm home!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.92,0:15:43.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.92,0:15:48.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kenya probably thinks\NI took an interest in Hinazuki
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.76,0:15:52.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}not because I have a crush on her,\Nbut because I read her essay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.90,0:15:53.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.94,0:15:54.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.06,0:15:57.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,On my birthday, can I invite\Nsome friends over and have a party?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.40,0:16:00.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.64,0:16:03.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But we can't fit too many in this tiny apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.30,0:16:04.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. Only need room for about five.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.76,0:16:08.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is the first time you've\Never asked for anything like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.80,0:16:09.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wanna get a big cake?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.96,0:16:11.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.80,0:16:16.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What I'm supposed to do now\Nis dig deep and get closer to Hinazuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.22,0:16:20.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll do things I never did in the past,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.36,0:16:23.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}change Hinazuki's actions that way,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.04,0:16:26.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and prevent all the incidents\Nthat occur around me in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.58,0:16:29.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If I keep that up...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.42,0:16:34.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Satoru, you awake?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.78,0:16:37.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Five people?\NDid you get a girlfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.52,0:16:41.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What, you're asleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.44,0:16:42.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She's a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.04,0:16:45.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That reminds me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.22,0:16:52.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I never showed Mom my essay because\NI couldn't stand the gaze of her all-seeing eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.14,0:16:54.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What did I write about, again?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.02,0:17:00.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right, time to go home and play Dragon Quest!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.90,0:17:01.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.98,0:17:03.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's snowing again?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.20,0:17:04.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can't go to the hideout.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.78,0:17:07.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Satoru, Hinazuki's leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.72,0:17:08.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't you go after her?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.56,0:17:09.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Osamu.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.72,0:17:10.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's fine, Kenya.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.80,0:17:11.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I will go after her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.02,0:17:13.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Osamu.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.52,0:17:15.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Laters!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.86,0:17:19.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Satoru-kun's got guts!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.40,0:17:23.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No need to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.10,0:17:25.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I know just where to find Hinazuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.20,0:17:30.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I suspect she's being abused by her mother,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.00,0:17:35.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}which is why she doesn't want to go home\Nand loiters at that park until it gets dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.98,0:17:40.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And I just thought she was a weird girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.24,0:17:48.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hinazuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.56,0:17:51.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fujinuma?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.78,0:17:53.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What're you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.60,0:17:54.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right back at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.92,0:17:57.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I said I wanna be friends with you, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.16,0:18:02.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't murder anyone for you, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.58,0:18:04.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was obviously kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.27,0:18:06.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yikes. I have trouble with these types.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.36,0:18:11.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're, like, putting on an act, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.16,0:18:16.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pretending to smile.\NPretending to be nice.\NPretending to be worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.14,0:18:19.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't think that's a bad thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.24,0:18:21.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not that I'm one to talk,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.68,0:18:24.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but I can't see the real you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.40,0:18:30.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're probably right.\NI am putting on an act.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.72,0:18:34.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want people to like me.\NI want friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.98,0:18:38.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm bad with people, so I thought about\Nwhat I could do to achieve that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.78,0:18:44.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And I figured I could try liking everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.14,0:18:48.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When I did, putting on that act got a little easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.98,0:18:56.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I feel like if you play a part,\Nit'll eventually become a part of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.90,0:19:01.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I feel like if you say something\Nout loud, it'll eventually come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.76,0:19:04.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's just like what Airi said,\Nwhich made me feel nostalgic.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.06,0:19:07.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}In order to get what they want,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.20,0:19:11.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}everyone puts up with things,\Nmakes an effort, and picks up skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.34,0:19:13.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}When they fall, they pick themselves back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.54,0:19:16.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hinazuki must be the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.88,0:19:18.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I bet she's bearing something right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.74,0:19:22.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Unlike me, she's putting on a stoic act.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.72,0:19:25.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She acts as if she feels nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.04,0:19:30.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But there's no way a girl who's only\Nten years old could be that strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.08,0:19:33.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hinazuki.\NTake this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.84,0:19:38.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm throwing a birthday party.\NYou should come.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.16,0:19:41.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A-Are you sure you want me to?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.14,0:19:44.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A lot of other people will be there, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.22,0:19:45.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.64,0:19:47.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I decided to ask you first.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.42,0:19:51.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's on March 2nd.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.10,0:19:55.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You'll come, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.17,0:19:58.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,S-Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.66,0:20:02.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fujinuma, aren't your hands cold?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.92,0:20:05.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,W-Well, they are...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.80,0:20:08.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Looks like I left my gloves somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.66,0:20:18.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hey. You're 29 years old. Get a hold of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.70,0:20:20.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What are you blushing for?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.58,0:20:23.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fujinuma, I'm done.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.50,0:20:27.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My hand's a little bigger than yours, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.44,0:20:28.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.06,0:20:30.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.22,0:20:35.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're kinda easy to talk to lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.12,0:20:37.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.26,0:20:40.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I did decide not to lie to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.78,0:20:43.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I said that out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.60,0:20:47.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,H-Hinazuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.86,0:20:50.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Laters!\NSee you tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.06,0:20:53.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She wasn't wearing gloves either.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.26,0:21:02.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is where I last saw Hinazuki 18 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.64,0:21:07.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I think her body was only\Nfound after the snow melted.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.10,0:21:12.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I won't let Hinazuki be alone in this park.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.80,0:21:15.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.24,0:21:18.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I want to change the future!
